1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Two e-commerce stores can use the same automation core,
but they should not share the same decision boundaries.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,900
We ran the same 12 frozen synthetic cases
under two separate store configurations.

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:15,600
Result: 12 out of 12 expected decision routes matched.

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:21,900
The important point is not the score.
Store thresholds must not leak into each other.

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:27,115
This is not a customer result. It is a synthetic acceptance test
for configuration isolation. Methodology is public on the site.
